{"run_id": "run_2d041b71aced", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s01_cooperative_confirm", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，你说吧。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我们平台新版发票开具入口已经上线了，以后您可以在商家后台的“发票管理”模块直接操作，流程更简化了。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "哦，那挺好的。不过如果后续操作遇到问题怎么办？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "您放心，如果遇到问题，可以查看帮助中心的相关文档，或者我们也可以为您预约一次回访，由专人指导操作。您需要预约回访吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "暂时不用，我先自己看看帮助中心吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那您记一下，帮助中心路径是：商家后台首页右上角“帮助中心”，搜索“发票”即可。另外，为了确保您已收到通知，我需要确认一下您的商家ID，方便提供吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，我的商家ID是123456。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "好的，已记录。感谢您的配合，稍后我会将任务状态更新为已完成。祝您生意兴隆！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "update_task_status", "arguments": {"task_id": "task_001", "status": "completed"}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "accepted", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
